[N 44-45 Zul'Farrak]
[D Forever Shaman 30-60 (Braedyn)\\Zul'Farrak at 44-45: Feathermoon - Thalanaar - Gadgetzan by flight, bind at Gadgetzan, Screecher Spirits to Yeh'kinya at Steamwheedle Port for The Prophecy of Mosh'aru, one run through Zul'Farrak (the Mosh'aru tablets, the Divino-matic Rod, Scarab Shells, and the Tiara, Nekrum's Medallion and Zum'rah's head for the eastern trip), then the Gadgetzan and Steamwheedle hand-ins.]
[GA Alliance]
[OC]|cffffffffLevel check|r  -  this chapter wants level 46: no quest here needs more than level 40, but the dungeon's trash is 43-47 and its bosses 45-48, all elite (Sergeant Bly 45; Theka the Martyr, Witch Doctor Zum'rah, Hydromancer Velratha, Nekrum Gutchewer 46; Shadowpriest Sezz'ziz 47; Antu'sul and Chief Ukorz Sandscalp 48). You arrive at about 44.5, the low end: look for a group of 44-48, ideally with a tank of 46 or more. At 44-45 do the quest bosses; Antu'sul and Chief Ukorz hold no quest item and can be left if the group struggles. There is no quest to do first: every pickup here is open at 40
[OC]|cffffffffFeathermoon to Gadgetzan|r  -  you start at the Feathermoon flight master where chapter 50 ended, hearth = Feathermoon; you bind Gadgetzan on arrival. Required chapter: one run of Zul'Farrak, |cFFFF0000GROUP 5|r, never a re-run. Four quests, 19,200 XP and 65s, plus the run's kills; three more quests are done in the run and handed in on the eastern trip of chapter 52
[OC]|cffffcc00Carried in:|r Screecher Spirits (3520, complete, chapter 47) to Yeh'kinya; Scarab Shells (2865, chapter 46); Nekrum's Medallion (2991, chapter 49), Tiara of the Deep (2846, chapter 50) and The Witch Doctor's Head (96770, chapter 43) for the run; The Brassbolts Brothers (2769) only if you took it in Ironforge; Clamlette Surprise (6610) only if chapter 46 gave it at Cooking 225
[OC][A Shaman] |cffffcc00Training:|r none due; no shaman trainer in Kalimdor on this route. The next one is Eldrun in Ironforge in chapter 52
[OC]|cffffcc00Sources:|r quest ids, mob and boss levels and drops come from the Forever DB and Wowhead Forever. The DB has no positions inside Zul'Farrak, so the dungeon lines carry no pin; the portal, the room order and the stairs event are Classic knowledge, not verified on Forever
At [TAR8019 Fyldren Moonfeather], |cFFfff8a3Fly to [F Gadgetzan]|r (the game routes it through Thalanaar) [G30.2,43.2 Feralas]

[OC]|cffffffffGadgetzan|r  -  bind, then the pickups around the inn
At [TAR7733 Innkeeper Fizzgrimble], bind your Hearthstone to [S Gadgetzan] (the Feathermoon bind ends here) [G52.5,27.9 Tanaris]
At [TAR7407 Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle], [QA2768 Divino-matic Rod] (6,300 XP at the hand-in: the Divino-matic Rod from Sergeant Bly in Zul'Farrak) [G52.5,28.5 Tanaris]
[O]At [TAR7804 Trenton Lighthammer], [QA3042 Troll Temper] (3,900 XP + 1g 95s at the hand-in: 20 Vials of Troll Temper from the Zul'Farrak trolls - grind/luck, never farmed) [G51.4,28.8 Tanaris]

[OC]|cffffffffSteamwheedle Port|r  -  Screecher Spirits first: it opens The Prophecy of Mosh'aru. The port has no flight point; ride north-east from Gadgetzan (about 16 map units, road unverified)
At [TAR8579 Yeh'kinya], [QT3520] (3,750 XP) [QA3527 The Prophecy of Mosh'aru] (5,250 XP at the hand-in: the First Mosh'aru Tablet from Theka the Martyr and the Second from Hydromancer Velratha in Zul'Farrak) [G67.0,22.4 Tanaris]

[OC]|cffffffffGahz'rilla (only with a mallet)|r  -  Gahz'rilla is summoned at the Gong of Zul'Farrak with the Mallet of Zul'Farrak. The DB gives the mallet no source; Classic makes it from the Sacred Mallet of Qiaga the Keeper (level 50 elite at the Altar of Zul in the Hinterlands), which the guide does not send you for. Ask when the group forms: only if someone in it has the mallet, ride north into Thousand Needles to Wizzle Brassbolts at the Mirage Raceway (road and distance not in the data, unverified) and back. No mallet: skip this block
[O]Mallet in the group and The Brassbolts Brothers in your log: at [TAR4453 Wizzle Brassbolts], [QT2769] (405 XP) [G78.1,77.1 Thousand Needles]
[O]Mallet in the group: at [TAR4453 Wizzle Brassbolts], [QA2770 Gahz'rilla] (7,100 XP + 75s at the hand-in: Gahz'rilla's Electrified Scale; whether he offers it without 2769 is unverified) [G78.1,77.1 Thousand Needles]
[O]No mallet in the group and The Brassbolts Brothers in your log: abandon it [QS2769] [G67.0,22.4 Tanaris]

[OC]|cffffffffZul'Farrak|r  -  |cFFFF0000GROUP 5|r. Trash 43-47 elite (Sandfury Shadowcasters, Blood Drinkers, Witch Doctors, Shadowhunters, Soul Eaters, Executioners, Sul'lithuz Sandcrawlers and Abominations, zombies); Scarabs and Dead Heroes are not elite; rare elites Sandarr Dunereaver, Dustwraith and Zerillis 45; bosses 45-48, all elite. One run, never a re-run. Your quests, with the honest label:
[OC]|cffffcc00?|r Divino-matic Rod (2768) - Sergeant Bly - |cff66ff66normal|r, one kill: Wowhead reads 36.92% because it counts every kill, quest or not. 6,300 XP at Bilgewhizzle
