[OC]|cffffcc00?|r Scarab Shells (2865) - 5 Uncracked Scarab Shells from the Scarabs (44-46, not elite) - |cff66ff66normal|r collection: about 36% a kill, budget about 14 scarabs inside the run. 3,900 XP + 65s at Tran'rek. Short after the run: abandon, no re-run
[OC]|cffffcc00?|r The Witch Doctor's Head (96770) - Witch Doctor Zum'rah - |cff66ff66normal|r, one kill (Wowhead 28.1% over all kills). Handed in at Archmage Lan'dalock in chapter 52
[OC]|cffffcc00?|r Tiara of the Deep (2846) - Hydromancer Velratha - |cff66ff66normal|r, one kill (Wowhead 43.09%), the same kill as the Second Tablet. Handed in at Tabetha in chapter 52
[OC]|cffffcc00?|r Nekrum's Medallion (2991) - Nekrum Gutchewer - |cff66ff66normal|r, one kill (Wowhead 11.68% over all kills). Handed in at Thadius Grimshade in chapter 52; The Divination (2992) there goes with it
[OC]|cffffcc00?|r Troll Temper (3042) - 20 Vials of Troll Temper from the trolls and zombies - |cffffcc00grind/luck|r: about 16% a kill, about 128 kills for 20. Loot what the run gives; abandon it after the run if you do not have 20
[OC]|cffffcc00?|r Gahz'rilla (2770) - only with the mallet - |cffffcc00grind/luck|r: the Electrified Scale from Gahz'rilla (Wowhead 33.6%), one kill only
